  "summary_en": "Japan Digital Agency's trademark and brand guidelines for \"Government AI Genai\", its government generative AI environment partly released as open source. It separates copyright licensing from brand use and sets permitted name and logo use by user type and modification level, with disclaimers to prevent confusion over government endorsement.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Code/document licence is separate from permission to use the name and official logo.",
   "Descriptive references to Genai are allowed without prior permission if they don't imply endorsement.",
   "Derivatives must have their own names and may not use the official logo.",
   "Five user categories (ministries, municipalities, corporations, individuals/groups, third parties) have tabulated permitted displays.",
   "Mandatory disclaimers and a Digital Agency contact desk handle misuse reports."
  ],
